OL,3,AUS inflation higher than expected in
OL,4,AOctober - here's what is happening with
OL,5,Aprices
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS inflation rose at a
OL,8,Ffaster-than-expected pace in October,
OL,9,Faccording to official figures.
OL,11,FPrices rose by 0.4% in the month, which
OL,12,Fwas lower than the 0.6% increase in
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FHowever, analysts had expected prices
OL,16,Fto rise by 0.3%, and the
OL,17,Fhigher-than-expected pace could add to
OL,18,Farguments for the Federal Reserve to
OL,19,Fraise interest rates at its next
OL,20,Fmeeting in December.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
